    "cardType": "DEFINITION",
    "front": "What is the **inverse function** $f^{-1}$?",
    "back": "The function that undoes $f$: if $f(a) = b$, then $f^{-1}(b) = a$.",
    "notes": "$f(x) = 4x + 7$, $f^{-1}(x) = \\frac{x - 7}{4}$.",
    "concepts": [
